WEBVTT

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.190
That Jahy...

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.660
Curse her for overstepping me,
 the Magnificent Saurva,

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.740
to become the Dark Realm's
 second-in-command.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.570
Ever since coming to the human world,

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.490
I've waited numerous times 
for the chance to defeat her.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.120
So many plans I've made and carried out...

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.890
<i>Yet so far, they've all ended in failure,</i>

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.380
<i>only causing me more stress and exhaustion.</i>

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.530
<i>That's why, today, I've decided...</i>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.180
<b>Bath</b>

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:39.180
<i>to refresh myself at the bathhouse!</i>

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:42.140
<i>I even splurged on nice shampoo.</i>

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:47.100
<i>Just for now, I'll forget all about Jahy  
and really focus on rejuvenating!</i>

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.350
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:04.140
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:04.930
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:05.640
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.430
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.380
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:23.780
<b>Restoration Plan No. 9

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.910
<b>Adults          500 yen
Students      400 yen
Children       300 yen</b>

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.910
<b>Women</b>

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.910
<b>Men</b>

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:42.930
<i>J-Jahy?!</i>

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:46.420
Ooh, what's this? 
Can't stand seeing me steal your sister?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.850
You...

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.870
<i>Oh, no! And she's with that punk?!</i>

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.330
<i>Pay your rent...</i>

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.570
Says the person enjoying 
being bathed like a child!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.650
<i>Damnation! Curse you, Jahy!</i>

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:05.490
<i>Does she intend to take even 
my place of relaxation from me?!</i>

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.800
<i>What a monster!</i>

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.700
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:14.350
<i>If she catches me like this, 
I won't last a second!</i>

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:19.920
<i>Should I run?</i>

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:23.890
<i>Wait, no. Luckily, it doesn't 
seem she's noticed me yet.</i>

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.100
<i>I should just quickly slip in while I can.</i>

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:35.190
<i>After all, I brought the best of the best
with this super nice shampoo!</i>

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:39.010
<i>The price tag was luxurious,
but so is the scent.</i>

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.150
<i>I bet this'll pick me up,
even under the circumstances.</i>

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.060
<i>J-Jahy?!</i>

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:10.630
<i>Wh-When the hell 
did she get right next to me?</i>

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.860
How does this shampoo smell so good?!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.400
It's so silky to the touch, too.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.370
<i>And she's using a ton of it!</i>

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.160
It's complimentary, too!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.350
This bathhouse is pretty great.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:25.840
<i>Hey, that's my shampoo! 
And it was super expensive!</i>

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.910
<i>But if I say something, I'll be found out...</i>

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.770
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.880
<i>No, this isn't the time to overthink things.</i>

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:34.330
Huh?

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:37.210
<i>I did it. I prevented the worst—</i>

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.420
<i>How is so much gone?!</i>

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:41.860
<i>That monster!</i>

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.900
<i>I haven't even had a chance to use it yet!</i>

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.810
<i>Jahy, you...!</i>

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.920
<i>It was like this in the Dark Realm, too.</i>

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.390
<i>You've been always getting in my way!</i>

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.440
<i>Will you ever be done making me miserable?!</i>

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.750
<i>Well, we're both unarmed.</i>

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.780
<i>It's time to take advantage 
of her carelessness.</i>

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.240
<i>Die, Jahy!</i>

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.150
Are you okay?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.550
Y-Yes.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:28.590
My... That's a rather dangerous
 place for a bar of soap.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.200
It's still slippery there. Be careful, okay?

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:34.500
Okay...

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.740
<i>That felt so good!</i>

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.380
<i>And I got to see the lady from the pub, too.</i>

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.020
<i>She was so soft...</i>

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:27.550
<i>I'll come again.</i>

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:34.120
<i>Despite everything, Saurva really 
enjoyed her trip to the bathhouse.</i>

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.580
<b>Craft
 Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.000
Thank you for waiting!

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:47.080
Please enjoy!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.910
She's in a better mood than usual.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.840
Right? Maybe something good happened to her.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:55.470
<i>Oops! I can't let myself get too giddy.</i>

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.310
<i>Today's finally the day.</i>

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.940
<i>After enduring such hardship 
and working like a horse...</i>

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.530
<i>It's payday!</i>

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.600
Here. It's this month's pay.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.120
Thanks for everything.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.530
Heck yeah!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.540
Make sure not to squander it, you hear?

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:18.260
Sorry, but new month, new me. 
I'm not the same as I used to be.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:25.960
Salary

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:23.750
<i>That's right! I've even sworn to 
forego my favorite thing, meat.</i>

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.960
<i>The reason for that is...</i>

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.670
<b>Hyper 
 Home Center</b>

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:33.890
<i>Today, I've come to this huge-ass store to 
buy a weapon to take down that magical girl!</i>

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.400
Now, magical girl, how shall I humiliate you?

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:44.730
This place sure is big, though...

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.880
I'm not even sure where to start.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:48.940
Take a look at this!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:53.910
That pesky grease clinging 
to your pans... is gone!

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:59.420
A five-pack of these amazing 
sponges is only 1,000 yen!

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:02.840
Boring.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.580
But that's not all!

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.840
I'll throw in three extra sponges
 for the same great price!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.290
Today only!

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:10.800
That's quite a bargain.

00:08:19.510 --> 00:08:21.750
That was an unexpected boon.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.420
I'll give one to my boss.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.400
We all know how tough it can 
be to cut up a pineapple.

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.360
But just have a look at this.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:33.570
See? This makes prepping
 pineapple a piece of cake!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.530
Boring.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.410
Who would ever buy that 
kind of useless stuff?

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.540
Can I interest you in a sample?

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:49.460
<i>That's so good!</i>

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.210
<i>With this, I could easily fix
 delicious pineapple every day!</i>

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.240
That was a great find.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.240
I'll let the landlord 
have some pineapple, too.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.810
Huh? Financial fortune... rocks?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.510
"Wear this and..."

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.780
<b>Increase your financial fortunes!!</b>

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.780
<b>POWER STONE</b>

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.780
<b>A lucky charm to attract money!</b>

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.780
<b>You're sure to get 
the things you want!</b>

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.780
I'm sure to get the things I want?!

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:18.990
<i>In other words, if I put this on, 
finding mana crystals will be a cinch?!</i>

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.170
<i>This is exactly what I need!</i>

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.900
Wow, what a lucky day!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.800
I'm finding all the bargains.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:42.320
<i>Now then, all that's left is to find something
to use against that magical girl.</i>

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.480
All right, where's their weapon section?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:50.440
<i>Hmm, they </i>do<i> say the quality 
of your sleep is important.</i>

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.300
<i>It's good for your skin </i>and<i> saves water?!</i>

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:59.620
<b><i>ULTRA BRILLIANT COATING</i>
Food comes off easily
No oil needed</b>

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.240
<i>This can't be real!</i>

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:59.140
<i>If it is, then what has 
all my suffering been for?!</i>

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.580
<b>Memory Foam
Urethane foam chip pillow</b>

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.580
<b>Ultra
Brilliant Coating
 Frying Pan</b>

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.350
Here we are!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:15.780
Hrm, I don't feel like this
 packs enough punch...

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.740
Can I even stab someone with this?

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.770
<i>That's it!</i>

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.870
Is that all you've got?

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.160
Shut up!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.040
Take this!

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.240
This is just a stick that lights up!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.240
These here!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.240
This, too!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.220
And those!

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.200
All of this!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.200
It's all useless!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.830
Why did I buy this crap?!

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:36.510
Give me my hard-earned money back!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.840
Wow, this works really well!

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.100
Are you sure I can have them?

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:47.950
Yeah.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.800
Thank you, Hy-chan!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.480
<i>The boss was happy!</i>

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>The Great Jahy</b>

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>The Great Jahy</b>

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.980
<b>Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:06.910
All right.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.330
Bring it on if you dare, magical girl.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.330
I'll turn the tables on you...

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.160
with this homemade, 
expertly cooked up birdlime trap!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:22.620
If she tries to barge in here, 
she'll get completely stuck!

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.290
And that's when I hit her with my magic!

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:29.800
Wait...

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:34.070
With her monstrous strength, 
she could easily get out of this trap.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.690
There's also no guarantee she'll 
try to come through the front door.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.890
She might come in the window...

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.180
If that's the case, then here! Take this!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.700
And that's not all! 
I have offensive traps, too!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.630
<b>Gong</b>

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:57.630
<b>Dong</b>

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:55.130
How's that?

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:57.630
I'll beat her for sure.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.720
Now all I've got to do 
is sit tight until she comes.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:04.270
Look at me! I'm such a strategist.

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.500
She's not coming...

00:13:49.900 --> 00:13:52.320
I'm getting hungry. 
Guess I'll have to take care of that.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.740
Time to go shopping for some dinner.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:25.170
<i>Now I've done it!</i>

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.460
<i>This can't be happening!</i>

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:29.890
<i>Does this mean I can't leave here
 until the magical girl shows up?!</i>

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.360
What if... she never comes?

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.270
Jaheek...

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.900
No, no, no, no....

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:46.690
Get over here already, magical girl!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:47.370
Right now!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.530
Right this instant!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.320
You want mana crystals? I've got one!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.820
Come!

00:14:52.130 --> 00:14:53.660
Come!

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:57.730
Hey, Ja-ko. I'm here for the rent.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.630
<i>Not you!</i>

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.620
Hey, what the hell is this?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.710
<i>Oh, no! The trap!</i>

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.920
Landlord!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.390
<i>If that washbasin hits her, 
she's really going to lose it!</i>

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:15.180
<i>I have to... distract her somehow!</i>

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.080
<i>Somehow!</i>

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.430
<i>This is the only way!</i>

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.010
Ja-ko?!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:31.160
Hey, Ja-ko? Are you okay? Hey!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.050
Landlord... are you okay?

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:39.570
Yeah, I'm fine, but what's all this?

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:41.820
It's a trap I made.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:42.750
Wha?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.630
I've changed, huh?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:49.490
To think that a day would come when I 
protect a human, and that human is you...

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:52.040
So forgive me.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.110
Uh, you set this up 
and took that hit yourself.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:01.450
Defense against the magical girl?

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:05.180
Yes. You never know when she's 
going to come attack me again.

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:08.190
Well, if that's what this is about, 
you should've come talked to me.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.410
I'm the landlord. It's my 
job to protect my tenants.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.870
You? Protect me?

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.450
I'm second-in-command of the Dark Realm!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:24.440
How are you this insufferable?!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.500
<i>Unbeknownst to the Great Jahy,</i>

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:32.000
<i>security measures around the apartment
were tightened that day.</i>

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:44.430
Challenging me with your pathetic strength?
Don't make me laugh.

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:47.440
I'll show you the power of 
the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.690
It's rent time. Pay up.

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:55.700
Woof! Woof, woof! Woof! Woof, woof! Woof!

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:05.960
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:14.410
<i>I need to move on to my new strategy...</i>

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:20.800
<i>But I'm so frightened of Jahy that I'm 
having nightmares about her every night!</i>

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.480
<i>How can she scare me so?</i>

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.040
<i>She's terrifying!</i>

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.740
<i>That hair...</i>

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.240
<i>It can't be!</i>

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:36.580
Unhand that!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:37.860
<i>Jahy?!</i>

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:43.230
<i>No, it's not... 
It's just a kid with her hairstyle.</i>

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:48.140
<i>Jahy's well endowed, sexy, and dignified.</i>

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.750
<i>She has an aura!</i>

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.880
Give it back, you bastards!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:56.190
<i>This kid isn't giving me any of those vibes.</i>

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:57.810
<i>Besides, there's no way that Jahy...</i>

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:59.900
<i>could be so adorable!</i>

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:01.520
<i>It's someone else!</i>

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.870
You there! Are you all right?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:08.940
You...

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.260
Who the hell are you?!

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:14.150
I-I'm just a passerby.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.190
Stay back!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:20.820
This is a fight to death over 
lunch between me and the crows!

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.790
<i>Wh-What a strong child!</i>

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:27.560
<i>She's so small yet fighting so fiercely!</i>

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.250
<i>Quite unlike me!</i>

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.880
I'll save you!

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.960
Come, crows! I am your foe now!

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:38.110
What are you doing?!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.180
No! That was my lunch!

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.570
This is all your fault, you maggot.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.270
M-Maggot?

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.780
<b>Salmon</b>

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.780
<b>120 </b>yen

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:01.000
I'm sorry. Please accept this as an apology.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:05.760
Hmph! I'm not so down on my luck
 that I'd accept handouts from strangers.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.370
I see.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:10.150
You're tough, aren't you?

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.000
Guess so.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:16.550
What do I have to do 
to become as tough as you?

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:22.120
What's that? You want to be tough?

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:23.410
Yeah.

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:29.040
There's someone I really want to defeat.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:30.500
That so?

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:36.220
But I kept screwing up 
and now I've lost faith in myself.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:38.100
I hear you.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:44.090
Even for me, there are times 
when things don't work out.

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.950
But I never ever give up!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:50.770
Even when things don't go my way,
again and again... I keep fighting!

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:53.630
So you can't give up either.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:57.500
If you keep at it, you'll 
beat them one day for sure!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.270
Yeah, I will!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.370
Thank you! I'll do my best...

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:14.920
Don't cry.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.640
You can do it.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.110
That reminds me! What's your na—

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:23.400
Waugh! It's time for work!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.040
W-Wait!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.550
She's gone...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.120
Again and again, huh?

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.430
She's right!

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.410
What are two measly failures?!

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:39.090
No matter how many times 
it takes, I'll keep going!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.390
Thank you...

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.390
strong girl!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:57.490
I've found you at last...

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.480
I've found you at last.

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:03.060
I've found you... at last!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.940
<i>Today you meet your doom!</i>

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:07.530
I've found you at last!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:10.080
What the hell is going on?!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.120
It's a regular weekday!

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:18.580
Why is it so damn busy?!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.160
Hy-chan, this is for table 2.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.550
Please get it out quickly.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:24.050
Can I get another warm towel?

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:25.090
Another beer, please!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.140
Me, too!

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.970
I heard you!

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.980
Please take care of table 3, as well.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:36.290
H-H-Hold it! I haven't even gotten
 the stuff to table 2 yet!

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:42.110
Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b>

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.810
M-Maybe next time...

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:52.680
Let's do that.

00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:57.780
<i>Not realizing that Jahy was the 
very girl who'd encouraged her,</i>

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:02.400
<i>Saurva lost to Jahy again today... 
unbeknownst to everyone.</i>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>The Magical Girl Will Not Lose!</b>
